Map data
--------
* The campus tiles under content/<pack>/campus/ and everything under design/osm/ are derived from
  OpenStreetMap. © OpenStreetMap contributors. Licensed under the Open Database
  License (ODbL) 1.0 — https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1.0/
  The baked model is a "derivative database" under the ODbL; if you modify and
  redistribute it, you must offer it under the ODbL too. Any UI that shows this
  map must credit "© OpenStreetMap contributors".
* (Planned, whole-campus pipeline) Building footprints and attributes from the
  Overture Maps Foundation buildings theme — ODbL 1.0, because it includes
  OpenStreetMap data. https://docs.overturemaps.org/attribution/
* (Planned) Microsoft US Building Footprints (Champaign County) — ODbL 1.0.
  https://github.com/microsoft/USBuildingFootprints
* (Planned) USGS 3D Elevation Program lidar,
  IL_8County_PlusChampaign_B3_QL1_2019 — US Government work, public domain.
  Building heights derived from it carry no licence restriction.

Reference photographs (design/refs/*.jpg)
-----------------------------------------
Downloaded from Wikimedia Commons for material and colour reference only; they
are not served by the application. Each file is Creative Commons licensed by
its photographer — the exact licence and author are on the file's Commons
page. Files: alma-mater.jpg, altgeld.jpg, beckman.jpg, foellinger.jpg,
grainger.jpg, krannert.jpg, siebel.jpg, stadium.jpg, state-farm.jpg, union.jpg.
If you redistribute these images, reproduce the per-file attribution from
Commons.

Text
----
* public/gl/monuments-info.json summarises facts from Wikipedia articles about
  the University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign campus. Wikipedia text is
  CC BY-SA 4.0 — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/ — entries
  marked "approximate": true are paraphrased from general knowledge.

Fonts
-----
The dashboard uses Silkscreen, Jersey 10, Pixelify Sans and VT323, all
released under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org/).
They are vendored under public/fonts/ and served from this origin. Nothing on the
dashboard reaches a font CDN, which is what makes the "no external requests"
gate in scripts/verify.sh mean something and what keeps a visitor's IP address
off a third party's logs for the sake of a typeface. The OFL text for each
family ships beside the files in public/fonts/.

